1
00:00:00,866 --> 00:00:02,246
[GRUNTS]

2
00:00:03,327 --> 00:00:04,997
- Excuse me.
- Mm-hm.

3
00:00:05,412 --> 00:00:07,122
[GRUNTS]

4
00:00:07,289 --> 00:00:09,749
- What is wrong with you?
- I'm helping you with Stephanie.

5
00:00:09,917 --> 00:00:12,627
(Leonard:)By making constipated moose sounds?

6
00:00:13,629 --> 00:00:17,759
When I fail to open this and you succeed,
it will establish you as the alpha male.

7
00:00:17,925 --> 00:00:21,765
(Sheldon:)You see, when a female witnesses
an exhibition of physical domination...

8
00:00:21,929 --> 00:00:23,849
(Sheldon:)...she produces the hormone oxytocin.

9
00:00:24,014 --> 00:00:27,974
If the two of you engage in intercourse,
this will create the biochemical reaction...

10
00:00:28,143 --> 00:00:31,733
...which laypeople naively interpret
as falling in love.

11
00:00:33,899 --> 00:00:35,229
(Steph:)Huh.

12
00:00:36,276 --> 00:00:39,406
(Leonard:)Would it work
if I just punched you in the face?

13
00:00:40,364 --> 00:00:42,994
(Sheldon:)Yes, actually, it would,
but let's see how the lid goes.

14
00:00:44,076 --> 00:00:46,826
(Sheldon:)I'm not strong enough, Leonard.
You'll have to do it.

15
00:00:48,413 --> 00:01:02,023
(Leonard:)- God's sakes.
- Go ahead, it's pre-loosened.

